{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2022-12-08 04:00:00', 'title': 'JACOBS WINS CONTRACT TO SUPPORT UK NUCLEAR REGULATOR', 'text': "DEEP TECHNICAL KNOWLEDGE UNDERPINS COUNTRY'S ENERGY SECURITY AND NET-ZERO CARBON AMBITIONS DALLAS , DEC. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JACOBS (NYSE:J) WAS SELECTED TO PROVIDE THE U.K.'S NUCLEAR REGULATOR, THE OFFICE FOR NUCLEAR REGULATION (ONR), WITH SPECIALIST ENGINEERING AND TECHNICAL SUPPORT SERVICES. THE FOUR-YEAR FRAMEWORK COVERS THE ONR'S ACTIVITIES IN NEW BUILD, POWER GENERATION, DECOMMISSIONING AND DEFENSE."}